ID: sec:doc:dhhs_policy:MA-2180:url-08aa92cd33e7:_s7
Title: A. Generally
Policy: MA-2180
Type: dhhs_policy
Citation link: [MA-2180 HEALTH COVERAGE FOR WORKERS WITH DISABILITIES](https://policies.ncdhhs.gov/wp-content/uploads/ma-2180-3.pdf)

Content:
To be eligible to receive HCWD, an individual must:
Be at least 16 years of age, but less than 65 years of age;
Meet the Social Security Administration definition of disability except for earnings or be eligible under the Medically Improved Group;
Be employed;
